Lattice licensing
=================

Lattice inherits its licensing from the included upstream projects.

Lattice 从上游继承许可证。

The server and API patch stacks derive from Purpur, Paper, Spigot, Bukkit,
CraftBukkit, and Minecraft. Source and binaries that form part of that derived
server distribution are licensed under the GNU General Public License version
3; see [licenses/GPL.md](licenses/GPL.md).

服务端与 API 补丁栈派生自 Purpur、Paper、Spigot、Bukkit、CraftBukkit 和
Minecraft。构成该派生服务端发行物的源码与二进制遵循 GNU 通用公共许可证
第 3 版，许可证正文见 [licenses/GPL.md](licenses/GPL.md)。

Standalone code authored for Lattice that does not derive from GPL-covered
upstream code is released under the MIT License unless its file or patch header
states otherwise. This includes the Lattice native library and Lattice-owned
support code. See [licenses/MIT.md](licenses/MIT.md). Combining that code into
the server binary does not remove the obligations inherited by the complete
server distribution.

由 Lattice 原创、且不派生自 GPL 上游代码的独立代码，在文件或 patch 头未另行
声明时采用 MIT 许可证；这包括 Lattice native 库与 Lattice 自有支持代码。
许可证正文见 [licenses/MIT.md](licenses/MIT.md)。这些代码被组合进服务端二进制
后，不会消除完整服务端发行物从上游继承的许可证义务。

Imported or adapted patches retain the original author, source, and license
stated in their patch headers. Some such patches use LGPL-3.0-only; see
[licenses/LGPL-3.0.txt](licenses/LGPL-3.0.txt). A patch without an explicit
more-permissive license must not be presumed to be MIT. When this summary and a
file or upstream license differ, the applicable file or upstream license takes
precedence.

引入或改编的 patch 必须在 patch 头中保留原作者、来源与原许可证。部分 patch
采用 LGPL-3.0-only，许可证正文见
[licenses/LGPL-3.0.txt](licenses/LGPL-3.0.txt)。未明确声明更宽松许可证的
上游 patch 不得推定为 MIT。本说明与具体文件或上游许可证不一致时，以适用于
该文件的许可证或上游许可证为准。
